  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1e8c93291e0eaf643b9bec9253640f5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MahaLunchWithFriends
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: Maha leads you away from Room 339 and into Room 127. Two students are waiting around a cluster of desks.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a55e95743489d504eb111849913139e1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -150, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 150, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ee90e6260886174ea2f1115333d6143, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 450, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a55e95743489d504eb111849913139e1, type: 2}
    text: Everyone, this is {playerName}. They are new here, so try to make them feel welcome.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
    text: Hi, I'm Aria. Maha has told us a little about you.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: -1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ee90e6260886174ea2f1115333d6143, type: 2}
    text: I'm Theodora. It's nice to meet you. We were just figuring out what to do with lunch.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Nice to meet you both. I thought it was just going to be lunch with Maha.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a55e95743489d504eb111849913139e1, type: 2}
    text: It is. They are my friends. Sit down before Aria decides the introductions need a second round.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
    text: I only do that when people look like they forgot my name.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: -1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ee90e6260886174ea2f1115333d6143, type: 2}
    text: You do it even when they remember.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
    text: See? This is what I have to put up with.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: -1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a55e95743489d504eb111849913139e1, type: 2}
    text: Speaking of putting up with things, Eleanor is still camped out in Room 339.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
    text: She practices her song there like the whole school is supposed to stop and listen.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: -1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ee90e6260886174ea2f1115333d6143, type: 2}
    text: And if anyone asks for the room, she acts as if they are trying to ruin her future.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a55e95743489d504eb111849913139e1, type: 2}
    text: She keeps to herself, then gets upset when no one is around to hear her out.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: You all really hate Eleanor?
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
    text: Yeah. I don't really want to be around her.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aeb00bc743a24afb90dffce6ca9a83f1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: -1
      actionType: 4
      coords: {x: 0, y: 0}
      moveSpeed: 0
      tintColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
      tintOpacity: 0
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ee90e6260886174ea2f1115333d6143, type: 2}
    text: Yeah. It's easier when she isn't there.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a55e95743489d504eb111849913139e1, type: 2}
    text: Yeah. I do.
    actions: []
    choice:
      prompt: 
      options: []
    endingScene: {fileID: 0}
    music: {fileID: 0}
    music2: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
